;THIS SUBMISSION IS AN RNA MODEL THAT HAS
 BEEN RIGID BODY FITTED INTO A 10A DIFFERENCE FOURIER ELECTRON
 DENSITY MAP BETWEEN NATIVE BLUETONGUE CORE DATA AND THE MODEL
 FOR THE CORE PARTICLE. THERE IS NO RELEVANCE IN THE SEQUENCE OF
 THE BASES IN THE RNA MODEL.
;
_pdbx_entry_details.has_ligand_of_interest   ? 
